adb-auto (1.3.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Bump version to 1.3.0.
  * Update documentation and man page with Quick Settings tile guidance.
  * Remove obsolete --pair command-line options in favor of native adb pair.
  * Prune redundant tarball packaging in favor of native Debian packaging.
  * Include Debian changelog in /usr/share/doc/adb-auto/changelog.Debian.gz.

